 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ayakashi Yashiki No Mayakashi Fufu ~ Keiyaku Fufu Wa Kamakura De Yokai No Tsudo Ie Omamoru ~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "あやかし屋敷のまやかし夫婦　～契約夫婦は鎌倉で妖怪の集う家を守る～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "What will happen to the newlywed life that began in an old house in Kamakura, a place where the Ayakashi gather?\n\nAfter the death of her parents, Makoto, who has lost her place in the world, temporarily marries Chihiro, a young novelist, and his new home is an old private house where the Ayakashi gather...?!\n\nSet in the ancient city of Kamakura. The story of the ayakashi contract couple is about to begin!",
   "ja": "妖怪が集う鎌倉の古民家で始まった新婚生活の行方は――？  両親を亡くしたあと、 居場所を失った真琴に与えられたのは 小説家の青年・千尋との仮初めの結婚―― しかも新居は妖怪が集う古民家で…？ 古都・鎌倉を舞台に紡がれる あやかしたちと契約夫婦の物語、開幕です！"
  },
